{"scene_description":"The image depicts the interior of a warehouse or storage facility. The space is characterized by high ceilings and concrete flooring, with various industrial elements such as metal shelving units and a blue metal gate. A gray SUV is parked in front of the gate, suggesting that this area may be used for loading or unloading vehicles. The shelving units are filled with cardboard boxes and pallets, indicating an active storage environment. There is also a yellow and red barrier in the foreground, which could be used to control access or direct traffic within the facility."}

